{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I have a strong lead. Chigozie Obioma was born in Akure, Nigeria. His novels \"The Fishermen\" (2015) and \"An Orchestra of Minorities\" (2019) were shortlisted for the Booker Prize and translated into 30 languages.\n\nBut the Booker Prize was established in 1969, not the 2000s. The question says \"the award itself\" was created in the 2000s. Let me reconsider - the Man Booker International Prize was established in 2005. Let me check the details of the Booker Prize page and the Man Booker International Prize.\n\nAlso, I need to verify: \"An Orchestra of Minorities\" was published in 2019 and shortlisted for the 2019 Booker Prize. The 2019 Booker Prize was won jointly by Margaret Atwood (\"The Testaments\") and Bernardine Evaristo (\"Girl, Woman, Other\"). Let me check if this fits the pattern.\n\nLet me read the Booker Prize page to understand the award structure, and search for the Man Booker International Prize.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"ref\": \"d1\"}","name":"read"},"id":"call_65d26db25e1349a8b70377af","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Man Booker International Prize established 2005 history\", \"International Booker Prize created 2005 2016 reconfigured\", \"Bernardine Evaristo born city biography\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_634e22a9c1114da19be81f68","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789476847,"id":"chatcmpl-f344de68-6db7-9cd9-91a6-ac0376a74ff8","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":20488,"completion_tokens":279,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":20767,"cached_tokens":13184,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":13184},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}